  "scope_statement": "Publicly evidenced PCF/LCA software products and their owner, developer, and operator roles. Products qualify when they perform LCA, calculate product carbon footprints, or directly implement standardized PCF exchange. General corporate-only carbon accounting, consulting, and service-provider listings are excluded from the verified software count.",
  "counting_rule": "One asset family per distinct software product. A module is separate only when public sources present it as a named product with a distinct function or access route. Directory appearances are candidate records and are deduplicated before promotion.",
  "limitations": "This is a dated reproducible lower bound, not a complete world census. Public pages were reviewed without registration, login, purchase, or form submission. Capability labels describe publicly stated functions and do not certify calculation quality, conformity, or implementation performance.",
